'}, {'content': {'response': "Although I'm from a science background but I felt like I'm better suited for business so I'm pursuing my bachelor's degree in business, my major being finance.", 'time_taken': 'null', 'realtime_evaluation': {'overall': {'relevance': 'strong', 'feedback': 'The response directly answers the question by providing the major of study.'}, 'answer_relevancy': [{'level': 100, 'reason': 'The response is completely relevant as it directly states the study major as requested.'}]}}, 'user_type': 'candidate', 'content_type': 'answer'}, {'content': {'time_limit': None, 'time_taken': 'null', 'full_response': 'Do you prefer studying in a group or alone?', 'realtime_evaluation': None}, 'user_type': 'assistant', 'content_type': 'question'}, {'content': {'response': "I prefer studying alone because I feel like it affects my concentration whenever I'm studying in a group and it's always easier for me to get the job done on my own other than explaining the methods to every team member every second.", 'time_taken': 'null', 'realtime_evaluation': {'overall': {'relevance': 'strong', 'feedback': 'The response directly addresses the question by stating a preference for studying alone and providing reasons.'}, 'answer_relevancy': [{'level': 100, 'reason': 'The response is fully relevant as it clearly answers the question about studying preferences.'}]}}, 'user_type': 'candidate', 'content_type': 'answer'}, {'content': {'time_limit': None, 'time_taken': 'null', 'full_response': 'What do you think are the advantages of studying in a group?', 'realtime_evaluation': None}, 'user_type': 'assistant', 'content_type': 'question'}, {'content': {'response': 'Even though I prefer studying alone but I definitely believe there are numerous advantages of studying in a group. For instance, peer learning. This has proven to be an effective method of learning. Communicating with your peers, gaining knowledge from them and learning from them.', 'time_taken': 'null', 'realtime_evaluation': {'overall': {'relevance': 'strong', 'feedback': 'The response directly addresses the question by discussing the advantages of group study.'}, 'answer_relevancy': [{'level': 100, 'reason': 'The response is fully relevant as it clearly outlines the advantages of studying in a group.'}]}}, 'user_type': 'candidate', 'content_type': 'answer'}, {'content': {'time_limit': '1 minute', 'time_taken': 'null', 'full_response': "Okay thank you. Now let's move on to part two. In this part I'm going to give you a topic and I'd like you to talk about it for one or two minutes. Okay before you talk you will have one minute to think about it. You can take notes if you wish. Here's a cue card and here's the paper and the pencil. Okay you have to describe a time when you had to solve a problem. Okay from now your time starts. You Remember you have one or two minutes for this so don't worry if I stop you I'll tell you when the time is up. Would you please start now?", 'realtime_evaluation': None}, 'user_type': 'assistant', 'content_type': 'question'}, {'content': {'response': "Okay so today I would like to talk about a problem that I faced and had to solve under pressure. It was a year ago when I first started my university. We were given a group project in our marketing course. We were tasked to design a comprehensive marketing strategy for a local startup. Suddenly we faced a significant problem when one of the team members abruptly decided to leave the course, leaving us short-handed. Every individual was assigned a specific part of the task so it was very difficult for us to cope up with that since we were already behind schedule. So we immediately decided to arrange a meeting and brainstorm ideas on how to mitigate the impact of losing a team member. We redistributed the workload amongst the remaining members and decided to ask for an extension of deadline from our faculty. We redistributed the workload according to the special skills and strength of every individual on the team. After asking our faculty he was kind enough to analyze our situation and gave us an extension of one week to submit our assignment. After that we worked relentlessly and diligently and we opened communication channels, worked effectively, helped each other throughout the entire process, communicated with each other in every part of the step and finally our hard work paid off. We were able to complete the assignment on time and after that we were also asked to present our ideas in front of the university faculties due to our report being extraordinary. So what I learned from this experience was the importance of adaptability, good communication skills and teamwork and I also learned the fact that having an obstacle doesn't necessarily always mean an issue. It could also be a way for people to show how resourceful they can be.", 'time_taken': 'null', 'realtime_evaluation': {'overall': {'relevance': 'strong', 'feedback': 'The response thoroughly addresses the prompt by describing a specific problem-solving experience.'}, 'answer_relevancy': [{'level': 100, 'reason': 'The response is fully relevant as it directly describes a time when the candidate had to solve a problem.'}]}}, 'user_type': 'candidate', 'content_type': 'answer'}, {'content': {'time_limit': None, 'time_taken': 'null', 'full_response': 'May I have the pencil and the paper please?', 'realtime_evaluation': None}, 'user_type': 'assistant', 'content_type': 'question'}, {'content': {'response': 'Thank you.', 'time_taken': 'null', 'realtime_evaluation': {'overall': {'relevance': 'strong', 'feedback': 'The response is appropriate as it acknowledges the request for materials.'}, 'answer_relevancy': [{'level': 100, 'reason': 'The response is fully relevant as it acknowledges the request for the pencil and paper.'}]}}, 'user_type': 'candidate', 'content_type': 'answer'}, {'content': {'time_limit': None, 'time_taken': 'null', 'full_response': "Okay now I'm going to ask you some follow-up questions. Do you think the problem could have been prevented?", 'realtime_evaluation': None}, 'user_type': 'assistant', 'content_type': 'question'}, {'content': {'response': "Not really. I don't think the problem could have been prevented because the faculty decided the team member for each group and it was not possible for us to understand the intention of an individual just by getting to know them.", 'time_taken': 'null', 'realtime_evaluation': {'overall': {'relevance': 'strong', 'feedback': 'The response directly addresses the question by explaining why the problem could not have been prevented.'}, 'answer_relevancy': [{'level': 100, 'reason': 'The response is fully relevant as it clearly explains the reasons behind the inability to prevent the problem.'}]}}, 'user_type': 'candidate', 'content_type': 'answer'}, {'content': {'time_limit': None, 'time_taken': 'null', 'full_response': 'And how would you handle a similar problem if it happens again in the future?', 'realtime_evaluation': None}, 'user_type': 'assistant', 'content_type': 'question'}, {'content': {'response': 'Well first of all I would start by analyzing the group members and making sure every individual is equally involved in the project as me and after that if the problem still arises then I would solve it the way I did a year ago.', 'time_taken': 'null', 'realtime_evaluation': {'overall': {'relevance': 'strong', 'feedback': 'The response directly addresses the question by outlining a strategy for handling similar problems in the future.'}, 'answer_relevancy': [{'level': 100, 'reason': 'The response is fully relevant as it clearly describes how the candidate would handle a similar problem in the future.'}]}}, 'user_type': 'candidate', 'content_type': 'answer'}, {'content': {'time_limit': None, 'time_taken': 'null', 'full_response': "Now move on to part three and I'm going to ask you several questions. What are some common problems that people face in their daily lives?", 'realtime_evaluation': None}, 'user_type': 'assis